~/.venvs/zenray-motion/bin/python -I Scripts/FontCreate.py match  --mask CROP.png --text "..."
~/.venvs/zenray-motion/bin/python -I Scripts/FontCreate.py create --mask CROP.png --text "..." --id ID
~/.venvs/zenray-motion/bin/python -I Scripts/FontCreate.py vary   --id ID --from V_001 --set global.weight_units=12
~/.venvs/zenray-motion/bin/python -I Scripts/FontCreate.py build  --params params.json --out font.ttf
```

Each `create` or `vary` writes a new version `/Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-zenray-motion-design/fonts/<ID>/V_NNN/` (font.ttf, params.json, fit.json, preview.png), never overwritten. A variation is a parameter change and a rebuild. A 1:1 font of a proprietary reference stays private in the workshop; only variations may be published after rights validation (Rules.md, 12 October 2026).

